mage\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Force_Conduit_(Condition)\" title=\"Force Conduit (Condition)\">Force Conduit</a> while surrounded by 2 or more enemies. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715143904\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 730/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5338/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1460/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1601/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 843808/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.247      1 -total\n 52.05%   23.551      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 51.25%   23.190      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 49.72%   22.497      1 Template:Ambox\n 47.87%   21.659      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 17.01%    7.696      1 Template:Cond\n  8.31%    3.758      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n  7.55%    3.415      1 Template:Icon_link\n  7.34%    3.321      1 Template:PageSeo\n  6.84%    3.093      1 Template:Icon_text\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30960-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715143904 and revision id 124367. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}